# systemd, target native: systemctl and libsystemd alone, for the dracut of the image run on the
# host by kernelbuild: its modules enable units with systemctl --root, and the dracut-install of
# lfs/dracut:native gets the JSON support (the dlopen dependencies systemd declares) from libsystemd
### Every automatic feature disabled: no library of the host, gperf and the jinja2 of the native
### python only. systemctl carries the shared code of systemd (link-systemctl-shared=false)
PKG_DEPS=
BUILD_PROCESS=custom
PKG_CHECK="${INSTALL_EXECPREFIX}/bin/systemctl --version 2>/dev/null | head -n1 | grep -q '(${PKG_VER})' && [ -f ${INSTALL_LIBDIR}/pkgconfig/libsystemd.pc ]"
